---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/CommonPage.astro'
import ContactQR from '@/components/contact/ContactQR.astro'
import wechat from '@/assets/wechat-contact.jpg'
import qqGroup from '@/assets/qq-group-contact.jpg'

const headings = [
  { depth: 2, slug: 'how-to-reach', text: 'How to reach me' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'before-you-add', text: 'Before you add me' }
]
---

<PageLayout title='Contact' {headings} info='/en/contact'>
  <p>
    Happy to chat — tech, job hunting, blog collaborations, or just hanging out.
    I'm slow to reply, but I do reply.
  </p>

  <h2 id='how-to-reach'>How to reach me</h2>
  <p>Hover over a card to reveal the QR code. For everyday discussion, join the fan QQ group — there's a weekly online talk too. WeChat is for paid consulting; add a note when you reach out.</p>
  <ContactQR
    class='my-6'
    items={[
      {
        name: 'Fan Chat Group (QQ) · for everyday discussion',
        hint: 'Hover to reveal QR',
        image: qqGroup,
        methodName: 'qq_group',
        note: 'Group number 831907794 · Verification: title of my latest blog post.'
      },
      {
        name: 'Paid consulting · WeChat',
        hint: 'Hover to reveal QR',
        image: wechat,
        methodName: 'wechat',
        note: 'Paid consulting / mock interviews only · include what you need'
      }
    ]}
  />

  <p>
    The group is a space for Agent / AI Native tech exchange and learning: industry news, product updates,
    learning notes, project retrospectives, quality resources, and worthwhile questions are all welcome —
    practitioners and beginners alike. Sharing your own understanding or helping answer someone else's question
    is part of how everyone learns here. When asking, include context, the error, and what you've tried.
    Full rules are in the group announcement.
  </p>

  <h2 id='before-you-add'>Before you add me</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Tell me why you're reaching out</strong>. One sentence is enough — e.g. "booking a mock interview" or "blog collab". Friend requests with no note will likely be ignored.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Business / promotion / recruiting</strong>: please share the context and what kind of collaboration you have in mind upfront, instead of opening with "hi".
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>The QQ group is for tech and life chat</strong>. No ads, spam, or off-platform recruiting — violators will be removed.
    </li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
